No. S9

CORRIGENDUM

INTERNATIONAL BANKING ORDER, 2000 (S 53/2000) In this Order, published in No. 33 of Part II of the Government Gazette, dated 29th. June, 2000, the folloviing corrections are made(i) in section 2(4){a}, the word "leading" should read as "lending"; (iil in section 3(2){b}, in the penultimate line the word "of" is inserted immediately before "international";

(iii) in section 15(1), the word "be" should read as "by";

(iv) in section 18(1), in the first line, the word "not" should read as "no";

(vii) in section 25{7), a comma is inserted in the first line immediately after "filing"; and

(viii) in the Third Schedule, in section 7{c}, the word "of" is inserted immediately before "security".
